Third-party notices

This project was inspired by, and borrows algorithms and UI-layout ideas from,
the following MIT-licensed projects. No third-party source files are bundled
with this repository except as noted:

1. AutoCourse-DB (https://github.com/) — MIT License,
   Copyright (c) 2026 JinHeng.
   Used for: the stable question key format (`[type] title | option | ...`)
   and the flat JSON question-bank format, which this project can import and
   export.

2. ocs-ai-answerer — MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 Liu Keda.
   Used for: the idea of per-question-type model routing, multimodal message
   assembly, and the answer post-processing pipeline.

3. ocsjs-ai-answer-service — no license file upstream; only its page layout
   and interaction design were taken as a reference. No source code was
   copied from it.